  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "2. Wrap beets in foil and roast for 45-50 minutes, or until tender.",
    "3. Remove beets from oven and let cool. Peel and dice.",
    "4. In a large bowl, combine diced beets, sliced onion, and apple cider vinegar.",
    "5. In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "6. Pour dressing over beet mixture and toss to coat.",
    "7. Taste and adjust seasoning as needed."
